<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">HEALTH RECORDS</view><view class="title">健康数据</view><view class="desc">手动记录数值，观察自身变化。不进行自动疾病诊断。</view>
<view class="card" wx:if="{{!readonly}}"><view class="card-title">新增一条记录</view><view class="label">指标类型</view><picker range="{{types}}" range-key="title" value="{{selected}}" bindchange="choose"><view class="select">{{types[selected].title}} ▾</view></picker>
<view wx:if="{{selected===0}}"><view class="label">收缩压（mmHg）</view><input class="input" value="{{systolic}}" type="number" bindinput="changeSys" placeholder="如 125"/><view class="label">舒张压（mmHg）</view><input class="input" value="{{diastolic}}" type="number" bindinput="changeDia" placeholder="如 80"/></view><view wx:elif="{{selected===1}}"><view class="label">血糖（mmol/L）</view><input class="input" value="{{glucose}}" type="digit" bindinput="changeGlu" placeholder="如 5.6"/></view><view wx:else><view class="label">体重（kg）</view><input class="input" value="{{weight}}" type="digit" bindinput="changeWeight" placeholder="如 63.5"/></view><button class="btn primary" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存健康数据</button></view>
<view class="card"><view class="card-title">历史趋势</view><view class="desc">最近的{{types[selected].title}}记录</view><canvas type="2d" id="trendCanvas" style="height:280rpx;width:100%;margin:20rpx 0 0rpx"></canvas><view wx:if="{{!shown.length}}" class="empty">暂无该指标记录</view></view>
<view class="section-title">最近记录</view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="item row"><view><view class="item-title">{{item.label}}</view><view class="item-sub">{{item.when}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!readonly}}" class="muted" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</view></view><view wx:if="{{!shown.length}}" class="empty">还没有记录，从上方开始填写</view></view><view class="hint">测量数据由本人或获授权社区工作人员录入，可能存在误差。如果身体不适，请咨询专业医疗人员。</view></view>
